+
+PENDING: check rows `F_(95,*)/G_(62,*)` for branch exponents `-77/-50`, what
+they assert, and why the assertions are necessary.
+
+### Q*-Pivot Rule
+
+PENDING: check that quotient pivots use only nonzero rational constant
+coefficients, including every stage-4 pivot.
+
+## Localisation and Residue
+
+PENDING: check whether branch parameters `rho` and `c` are ever used as linear
+pivots, and whether the stage-4 unit residue appears before any localisation in
+`rho` or `c`.
+
+## Hidden Specialisation Audit
+
+PENDING: enumerate numerical choices and distinguish licensed gauge/coordinate
+normalisations from unlicensed slices.
+
+## Delta=5/2 Sanity Contrast
+
+PENDING: compare against the frozen delta=5/2 stage-7/next-stage-8 data to
+confirm that the same engine and row architecture remain consistent there and
+the delta=2 kill is branch-specific.
+
+## Verdict
+
+PENDING: CONFIRMED / GAP / REFUTED.

