+
+Prime mark/derivative: `p'` and `q'` in the split-face ODE mean `d/dpi`.
+
+No exit-price assertion is made, so no `charge_basis` line is applicable.
+
+## Final Verdict
+
+`CONFIRMED`. Every imposed row family used by stages 0-4 is a necessary
