+| stage | pole `(F,G)` | Jacobian band | outer raw/rank | joint Q* cum | residue | dimension | wall/RSS |
+|---:|---|---|---:|---:|---|---:|---:|
+| 0 | `(-77,-50)` | `J162:k27` | `64/41` | 0 | 0 | 1065 | `68.21s / 72384K` |
+| 1 | `(-76,-49)` | `J162:k28..162` | `52/38` | 9 | 0 | 1018 | `53.51s / 77048K` |
