+
+```text
+stage4_J_d159_k35 = 6264
+```
+
+Thus `1 = (1/6264) stage4_J_d159_k35` in `Q`. The replayed stage-4
+`all_labeled_rows_hash` and `residual_hash` match the frozen charged
