+END_DIM
+BEGIN_GB
+1
+END_GB
+BEGIN_CONTROLS
+0
+1
+0
+END_CONTROLS
+```
+
+The output SHA-256 is
+`236517b4a8e5567c586d39194059d49207001416a1d922efaec1fc3d2b9c7b73`.
