+### Outer D2 And D1 Rows
+
+`CONFIRMED[NECESSARY-STRICT-OUTER-ROWS]`. The outer bridge imposes the same
+Theorem 1.2 bounds on `A2,A3,B1,B2` at the major first point. For `D2`,
