+### Direct Jacobian Rows
+
+`CONFIRMED[CONSTANT-JACOBIAN-ROWS]`. The engine forms the normalized sparse
+Jacobian:
+
+```text
+99*KF*(KG)_w - t*(KF)_t*(KG)_w
+-66*(KF)_w*KG + (KF)_w*t*(KG)_t
+```
