+## Necessity Audit
+
+### Common h3 / Major h2
+
+`CONFIRMED[NECESSARY-PREFIX]`. Moh Theorem 1.2 is used only as an order lower
+bound: if `Q = h^d + sum Q_j h^(d-j)`, then
